id=netstats-fix
name=Network Stats Fix for GSI
version=v13
versionCode=13
author=Hirbod-JORFlint
description=Universal fix for broken traffic indicator on Android GSIs. (1) BPF repair via kver_override + bpfloader restart with APEX fallback, (2) Native binder proxy (v5.0) with dual check strategy for broader compatibility, (3) Comprehensive SELinux policy with per-device handling, (4) Stub bpfloader detection and real bpfloader discovery, (5) Netstats file fallback for devices where BPF/netproxy fail, (6) Watchdog monitoring. Handles system, system_axion, system_infinity variants. Safe for all devices - no boot loops.
